  "body": "Lands the **corrected, vendor-neutral** CACHE-HAUNT work on `main`.\n\n## Why a second PR\n`main` had already received an early squash of #27 that carried the **first-draft, vendor-coded `ghost_anthropic.py`** \u2014 and independently advanced the Grimoire to **3.5.0 (web-aware Intellige molt)**. This PR reconciles both, per the Single-Truth / version-lock law:\n- removes the vendor module `ghost_anthropic.py`;\n- adds the neutral substrate `ghost_http.py`;\n- stacks the CACHE-HAUNT molt as **3.6.0 on top of** the web-aware Intellige 3.5.0 (**preserved intact**), so there is one canonical version.\n\n## The neutrality law (the correction)\nMantleOS is a nervous-system transplant: it must join **any** MIND to **any** container, so a provider is **configuration, never code** \u2014 matching `mind/transport.py`'s pluggable `model(prompt)->text` with no vendor SDK. The first draft coded a company into a substrate (named it, imported its SDK, hardcoded model IDs / TTLs / request shape). This replaces it with `HttpPromptCache`: OpenAI-compatible, pure-stdlib `urllib`, provider entirely configured (`url`, `model`, `headers`, `window_s`, `min_prefix_tokens`, optional `request_shaper`). Nothing hardcoded.\n\n## The window-feasibility law (DO-NOT-HAUNT)\nProvider cache windows vary widely (most 15\u201360 min; some ~5 min) while the heartbeat is fixed (~10 min). Where the window is shorter than the heartbeat the prefix is cold on every wake \u2014 so the framework returns **DO-NOT-HAUNT**, remedied by lengthening the window or a **supplemental forced beat** (keep the scheduled beat, push a one-shot forced beat partway through the window \u2014 a 10-min beat + a forced beat at +4 min covers a 5-min window without touching the base timer). New hard fails **HF-GHOST-6** (window < heartbeat kept alive) and **HF-GHOST-7** (vendor coded instead of configured); also the write-only, prefix-stability, and minimum-prefix laws (HF-GHOST-4/5).\n\n## Gates\n`ghost selftest` 57/57 \u00b7 Stage-1 PASSED \u00b7 73/73 invariants \u00b7 GHOST.png verify green \u00b7 version lock 3.6.0 across both Grimoire files, web-aware Intellige 3.5.0 row preserved.\n\nNot yet exercised: `ghost_http.py` against a live endpoint (needs `GHOST_CACHE_URL`/`GHOST_MODEL`/`GHOST_KEY`).\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
